OL,3,GNEWSAFree buses to be considered for
OL,4,A2027 budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's bus service could be made
OL,7,Ffree for a year if an amendment to next
OL,8,Fyear's States budget is approved.
OL,10,FDeputies Sally Rochester and Ross Le
OL,11,FBrun want the Policy and Resources
OL,12,FCommittee to give the Environment and
OL,13,FInfrastructure Department #1.9m to
OL,14,F"enable the existing public transport
OL,15,Fservice" to be made free of charge, or
OL,16,F"subject to a nominal annual fee" in a
OL,17,Fone-year pilot.
OL,19,FThe proposal is one of 30 changes put
OL,20,Fforward to next year's budget,
OL,21,Fscheduled for consideration on 3
OL,22,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
