OL,5,
OL,6,FOther amendments put forward include
OL,7,Fefforts to secure money for States'
OL,8,Fcommittees faced with budget cuts,
OL,9,Fattempts to freeze fuel duty and cuts
OL,10,Fto overseas aid.
